## 定理 541.1（Chebyshev–Stieltjes jet）

若：

$$
P_n(x)
=
\sum_{k=0}^{n}
p_{n,k}x^k,
$$

则：

$$
\boxed{
m_n(\sqrt u)
=
\sum_{k=0}^{n}
p_{n,k}
u^k
\frac{
(-1)^k
}{
k!
}
B^{(k)}(u).
}
\tag{541.6}
$$

### 证明

$$
\cos(n\theta)
=
T_n(\cos\theta)
=
P_n
\left(
\frac{u}{\xi^2+u}
\right).
$$

所以：

$$
\begin{aligned}
m_n(\sqrt u)
&=
\sum_{k=0}^{n}
p_{n,k}u^k
\int
\frac{d\nu(\xi)}
{(\xi^2+u)^{k+1}}.
\end{aligned}
$$

而：

$$
B^{(k)}(u)
=
(-1)^kk!
\int
\frac{d\nu(\xi)}
{(\xi^2+u)^{k+1}}.
$$

∎

